│     --with markdown-it-py python -m unittest discover -s tests -p
│     'test_*.py'.
│     Without a short TMPDIR the socket tests fail with "OSError:
│     AF_UNIX path too long" inside a long worktree path; without
│     markdown-it-py the render/features imports fail.
│     Baseline: 470 tests, 1 skipped.
